Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,漫漫阶梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stairs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我快不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 你们先行一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, just start without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我稍后就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,舒坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,波澜不惊 方能心如止水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inner peace. Inner peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻子好痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itchy nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,阿嚏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-choo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,终于静心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, inner peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,又怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞 老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Oogway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你我之争早在五百年前就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our battle ended 500 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可我已经准备好再比一场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I'm ready for a rematch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备得可真够久的 哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took you long enough. Ha ha ha ha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,呀啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yaaa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你变强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've grown stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,五百年灵界的修炼 不是白练的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}500 years in the Spirit Realm, you pick up a thing or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经夺走了这里每个大师的气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have taken the Chi of every Master here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很快你的力量也是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And soon I will have your power too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你何时才能领悟 索取越多 收获越少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When will you realize, the more you take, the less you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有了你的气 我终于又可以重回凡界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your Chi, I will finally be able to return to the mortal world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次 你阻止不了我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this time, you won't be there to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 阻止你从来都不是我的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, it was never my destiny to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经有了一个好的人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have set another on that path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就找到他 然后把他的气也夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will find him, and take his Chi too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.85,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,正义就要得到伸张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice, is about to be served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们来两份正义套餐 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have two justice platters, please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 三份 - 三份 - 再要几个豆腐花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Umm...three - Three. - And a few tofu buns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还要一碗香辣拌面 给娇虎的 你要另外加酱料吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the spicy noodle soup for Tigress. Did you want extra sauce with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她要多加酱料的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants it on the side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多加酱料 - 多加酱料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On the side. - On the side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,神龙 你能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon, you can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 冲吧 神龙大侠 - 保卫村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, Dragon Warrior. - Defend the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去呀 神龙大侠 - 保卫村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go Dragon Warrior. - Yeah, defend the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yee-ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没摆华丽的造型 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys aren't doing the dramatic pose, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要每次出场都摆个造型吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have to strike a pose every time we land?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙儿 永远不要低估华丽出场的威力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, never underestimate the power of a dramatic entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说某些大师只靠破门之势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard about some Masters who could win a fight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就能闪瞎对手赢得战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just by throwing open a door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuh-sha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,华丽出场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dramatic entrance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Shifu{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,神龙大侠说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dragon Warrior is correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 我只是随口 啊对 我就这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I was just making... yeah, I mean, yeah, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,双方交战先比气势 后比拳头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the battle of the fist comes the battle of the mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 出场就是要华丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence...the dramatic entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好华丽的出场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, nice dramatic entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今天是什么日子呀 - 今天将是我的最后一堂课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the occasion? - Today will be my final class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你的最后 等等 我都不知道你病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your final...? Wait. I didn't even know you were sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 虽然你看上去是有点 - 我没病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Although you have been looking a little... - I'm not sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,健康 有点健康 应该说很健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}healthy. A little healthy. A lot actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,之所以是最后一课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My final class because from now on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为接下来 负责你们训练的将会是神龙大侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your training will be in the hands of the Dragon Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我来教 为什么不是娇虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? teach? I mean why not Tigress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她总是喜欢吆喝别人做这个做那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's always telling everyone what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 阿宝 - 看到了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be quiet Po. - See what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,娇虎不是神龙大侠 你才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tigress is not the Dragon Warrior. You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.27,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了 他们可是盖世五侠 我能教他们什么呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on they're the Five. What can I teach them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,学海无涯 就连师傅也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is always something more to learn. Even for a Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,打个比方 我来教你另一招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance, let me show you another move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,华丽退场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dramatic exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗 这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? That...what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他去哪儿了 - 师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd he go? - Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经走啦 别那么严肃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone guys. It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,听从您的指点 师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We await your instruction, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽管放马过来便是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to lose is our respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 能有多糟糕呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, how bad could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,非常糟糕 非常非常糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very bad! Very, very bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们换别的招式 金猴 使出稳如泰山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, let's switch it up. Monkey, Immovable Mountain Stance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是 师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是说 娇虎 旋风后空翻 - 是 师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean... Tigress, Tornado back flip. - Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢不 火 - 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh no, fire. - Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我的错 仙鹤再飞高点 啊不 低一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, my fault. Crane go high, I mean low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我的小钳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my claw thingy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 灵蛇和娇虎 来一招虎啸蛇盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Viper and tigress, to... like a totem pole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放毒 进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poison, Technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩 使出白鹤亮翅 猴子摘桃 黄马褂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two, to... Sworming insect bite with yellow tail, Yellow jacket...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,香辣 金枪鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spicy...tuna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你干的好事 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job, Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你有学到一点点东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you at least learn a little something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有 你不是当老师的料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that you can't teach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 原来娇虎是易燃物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tigress is flammable, turns out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,简直惨不忍睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a complete disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我真庆幸自己不是阿宝 - 他真是一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm glad we're not Po right now. - What a loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道师傅是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was Shifu thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟大师又是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was Oogway thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得被他听到了 - 我啥都没听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think he heard us. - I didn't hear anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you're a loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Oogway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别这样了 - 你的第一课感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you stop doing that? - How was your fisrt day teaching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超丢脸 - 我听说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Humiliating. - I heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的 是娇虎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who told you? Did Tigress tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:09:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,金猴 仙鹤 螳螂 你爸和隔壁礼品店的周大妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard from Monkey and Crane and Mantis and your dad and Mrs. Chau from the gift shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有刚走过的那群鸭子以及娇虎告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those ducks who just passed and Tigress told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那她有没有告诉你我以后再也不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well did she also tell you that it'll never happen again cause I'm done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指授课 还是丢脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teaching, or being humiliated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,都是 我都不知道你为什么认为我能教他们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both. I don't know why you ever thought I could teach that class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I knew you couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啥 你故意的吗 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You set me up to fail? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你只做你力所能及的事 你就没法进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you only do what you can do you'll never be more than you are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要进步了 我这样就很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna be more. I like who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你连自己是谁都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你说啥 我当然知道 我是神龙大侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you...? Of course I do. I'm the Dragon Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那神龙大侠究竟意味着什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what exactly does that mean Dragon Warrior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,意味着 我要四处闯荡 拳打脚踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means...you know...just going around and punching and kicking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,保卫家园什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defending the valley and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,拳打脚踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punching and kicking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这就是乌龟大师看中你的原因吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that is what the great Master Oogway saw for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一个五百年的预言选中了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A five hundred year prophecy full-filled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,难道就是让你耍耍花拳绣腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can spend your days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,满镇子乱跑跟兔子耍帅吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kicking butt? And running through town high-fiving bunnies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗 - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 乌龟与我的意见相悖 他在你身上看到了潜能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oogway saw greatness in you, Po, against my better judgement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比你想象的还要多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than you can see in yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种神功等着你去发掘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible power awaits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这种神功强大到你无法想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power beyond anything you can imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么神功 - 这就是气功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - That was chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 气是啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What's chi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,世间万物流转的能量就是气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The energy that flows through all living things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你的意思是 如果我当了他们的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're saying if I, so you're saying if I teach,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以练成这种神功了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be able to do cool stuff like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说如果你当了他们的老师后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm saying if you teach,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以练成这种神功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be able to do cool stuff like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 气的运用需要自我修炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. - Mastery of chi requires Mastery of self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟曾在一个山洞里打坐整整三十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oogway sat alone in a cave for thirty years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只为弄清一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}asking one question...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能安静五分钟让我说完就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm lucky if I get 5 minutes before you interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我现在要找个山洞呆上三十年吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now I have to sit alone in a cave for thirty years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,最后 当你完成授课的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually. After you Master teaching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,授课 我根本不可能做到像你这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teaching? There's no way I'm ever gonna be like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我没让你变成我这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to turn you into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是让你变成你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to turn you into you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我变成我自己 等会儿 这没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn me into me? Wait a second. That makes no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲 师傅 说得再玄乎一点 你就是下一个乌龟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there Shifu , just a little more confusing and you'll be the next Oogway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 乌龟大师 无意冒犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, no offense Master Oogway I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不打扰您的安宁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you get back to your eternal peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是哪儿 - 呃 我哥哥的菜地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this place? - Aaah...my brother's farm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那如果我踩你一脚 你会死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. If I stepped on you, would you die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是凡界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mortal realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗 乌龟 我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that Oogway? I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai has returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 天煞 所向披靡的天煞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Kai. General Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这片神州大地最高的统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supreme warlord of all China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,追魂翡翠 苦难之师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jade slayer, Master of pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那你至少应该听过复仇之兽吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may know me as the beast of vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,寡妇制造者呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maker of widows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我以前跟乌龟是战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, I used to work with Oogway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 乌龟大师 他可是名副其实的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Master Oogway, he was a great warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道乌龟大师 又智慧又\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've heard of Master Oogway. Wise and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, ok, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,找到乌龟的弟子 全部抓来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Oogway's students and bring them to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等我夺走了他们的气 乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time I am done with them, Oogway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上就没人会记得你的名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no one left to who will even remember your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 我天煞来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha ha! Kai is coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am ready...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来教训你了 - 教训我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to teach you a lesson. - Teach me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦不 是神龙大师 - 妈呀他太帅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh no, it's the Dragon teacher. - Yeah he's so handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the compliment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 绕我一命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please don't teach me to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 老爸 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey dad. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是 回家泡个澡而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like just...stopping by for a little soak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说吧 出什么事啦 - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, What's wrong? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我回家发现你在这跟你的娃娃鸳鸯戏水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing? I come home to find you taking a bath with your dolls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是人偶 - 而且加的不是浴盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Action figures. - And instead of adding bath-salt to the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 反而加了四川辣椒面 - 啥 四川辣椒面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just added szechuan peppercorns. - Szechuan, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 噢 我白嫩的小屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, oh, oh...my tenders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 我是有心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, yes, something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,乖儿子 告诉爸爸发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there, son , you tell your daddy all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,胳膊抬起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift your arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅说我还不知道神龙大侠的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shifu says I don't know what it means to be the Dragon Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我居然还要当老师了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I have to be a teacher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我找到了自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I finally knew who I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可如果我不是神龙大侠 那么我又是谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm not the dragon Warrior, then who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 教人功夫吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A teacher? Teaching kung fu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 这可是份美差啊 还犹豫啥 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, that's a promotion. Take the job, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等有一天 你掌管了翡翠宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And someday, when you're in charge of the whole Jade palace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以在大厅里卖面条了 哟呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can sell noodles in the lobby. Yoohoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还在这泡澡 跟个娃娃似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you still here taking a bath like a baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,起来 起来 赶紧去干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out. Get up. Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的店面就要扩张啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franchise expansion awaits us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那神龙大侠模仿大赛怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Dragon Warrior look alike contest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 反正周大妈每次都赢 - 接招吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mrs. Chau always wins that. - Skadoosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那神龙大侠吃包子大赛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Dragon Warrior dumpling eating contest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我要保持我的不败记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to defend my title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能打破你吃包子的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's gonna beat your dumpling eating record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要打破你吃包子的记录啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's about to beat your dumpling eating record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在吃我的包子 - 账算在谁头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's eating my dumplings? - And who's paying for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一百零一 一百零二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}101, 102.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一百零三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}103.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,新纪录吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a new record?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是李山 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Li Shan - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫李山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Li shan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你儿子不见了 - 是啊 多年以前丢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You lost your son? - Yes, many years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也跟我爸爸失散了 - 真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I lost my father. - Very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well , good luck to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是 希望你能找到你儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too. I hope you find your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我也希望你能找到你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hope you find your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 儿子 - 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Son? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 真是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my gosh, it is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻站着呀 快给你老爸一个拥抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't just stand there! Give your old man a hug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢相信你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我永远地失去你了 小莲花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd lost you forever, Little Lotus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这下有点尴尬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Okay. This is very embarrassing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你认错儿子了 我不叫莲花 我叫阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think you've got me confused with a panda named Lotus. My name is Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊对了 你也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh right, you wouldn't... Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 小莲花是你的乳名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, Little Lotus was the name you were given at birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信 这么多年了终于找到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. After all these years and you're really here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 这位是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dad. Come say hi to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我不知道应该怎么称呼你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um. I don't know...I don't know what I'm supposed to call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚才说他叫李山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pretty sure he said his name is Li.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你 来抱抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...come here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太谢谢你了 把我的儿子照顾得那么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, thank you for taking such good care of my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的儿子 先等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son? Now hold on just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道这个人跟你有没有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know this stranger is even related to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你看啊 一看肚子就知道是自家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. Our bellies could be brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿儿子 我来教你怎么拱肚子 来 拱肚子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey son, let me teach you how to Belly Gong. All right, belly gong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,太酷炫了 它们震动的频率还一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's so cool. They jiggle the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像在照镜子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like looking in a fat mirror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真想不到 我们还能一起合影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we're taking a picture together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是不明白 我以为阿宝是最后一只熊猫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I still don't understand. I thought Po was the only panda left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 还有一大群呢 - 在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, there's a whole bunch of us. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就在山里的神秘熊猫村里 - 神秘熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, a secret panda village in the mountains. - A secret panda...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你是怎么知道我在这的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how did you know where I was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到的消息指引我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I received a message that led me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没人找得到你 你是怎么收到消息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you receive a message if no one could find you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,太可疑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds suspicious to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等 这是一则来自宇宙的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait, wait. It was a message from the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦哦哦哦 - 哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ooooooh! - Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇噢 - 扯淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa. - Rats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在说说 神龙大侠是怎么一回事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what's all this about a Dragon Warrior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我就是神龙大侠 是宇宙告诉你的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know I was the Dragon Warrior? Did the universe tell you that, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,海报上写着呢 还有礼品店 我买了一个小杯杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the poster did, and the gift shop. I bought a tiny cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh right, of course...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你得看看 你不知道我有多少东西要给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta...you have no idea there's so much to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你会为我自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be so awesomely proud!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀 来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经很为你自豪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already awesomely proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有几级就到了 - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. Couple more steps. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉脂肪在燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling the burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你也有熊猫哮喘综合征吗 我们是不是家族遗传啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have panda asthma, too? Does that run in the family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 你肯定会爱上这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you're gonna love this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有最炫酷的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the coolest thing ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是英雄之殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the hall of heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,收藏了武林中所有的奇珍异宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home of the most priceless kung fu artifacts in all of China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 这儿真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. This place is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 你准备这样说对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome? You were going...you were going to say awesome, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为真是太棒啦 - 太棒啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because it totally is! - Totally!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你要超级小心 这里都是些易碎品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But be super careful, everything is very fragile here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说这个装着武士耳语的灵坛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the Urn of Whispering warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就有人打碎过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone broke that once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 某个傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Some idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是飞天犀牛大师的战甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Master flying Rhino's battle armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇我能不能塞进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if I could fit in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我肚子里的蛔虫吗 老爸 我跟你想的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my head, dad. I've wondered the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道我穿不穿得下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could fit in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿不穿得下 不 是我穿不穿得下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could? No, if I could fit in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 过来看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, check it out.{\r}
