Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有觉得自己坚不可摧吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it feel like you're impenetrable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有觉得自己能够以一敌千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it feel like you can take on a thousand warriors{\r}
