Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吐吧吐吧 - 我没事 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There, there - I'm fine, I'm fine.{\r}
