Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要来了 - 那就来吧 犀牛大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm coming for you. - Bring it on Master Rhino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要追上你了 追上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you. I'm gonna get you.{\r}
