Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.13,0:22:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 跟我朋友打声招呼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad. Say hi to my friends,{\r}
