Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:22:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定很累 你一定很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he's tired. I'm sure you're tired.{\r}
