Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你就要见识神龙大侠的厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can see what being the dragon warrior is all about.{\r}
