Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看 是你 - 阿宝 专心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look. It's you. - Po, focus!{\r}
