Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.59,0:25:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在跟我说话吗 - 哪个 他们三个都在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he talking to me? - Which one? They're all talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.99,0:25:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对 太恐怖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. That's so scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该也要试试看 说不定能反过来吓唬他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should try that, too. Maybe it'd be scary back at them.{\r}
