Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.10,0:25:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然的话 那就不是可怕了 而是蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise it won't be scary, it'll be just stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他们在说话 白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not them talking, you idiots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.43,0:25:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是我在通过他们说话 我是天煞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me talking through them, Kai!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 好好 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Okay, okay, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗 看到了吗 - 发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you see that? Did you see? - What just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.59,0:25:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那些绿烟就咻的一下 又咻地消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The green smoke just poof...and then poof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅 那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shifu, what wast that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.52,0:25:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞 天煞 天煞 是谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai? Kai? Kai?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.90,0:25:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Never heard of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞 天煞 在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai... Kai... Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里太多装满智慧的卷轴了 什么都找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much wisdom in here, I can't find anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.43,0:26:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所有答案都将在这里找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the answers will be found within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.09,0:26:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? It's blank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是在耍我吗 又来这套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.34,0:26:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等一下 抱歉 好了 我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. Hold on. Sorry, okay, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是乌龟亲手写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is written in Oogway's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很久以前 我有一个兄弟 - 乌龟竟然有兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Long ago, I had a brother. - Oogway had a brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.33,0:26:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,战友 是战友 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In arms. In arms, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.37,0:26:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他写的是兄弟般的战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says brother in arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能一次都展开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you just unroll it all at once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.11,0:26:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是一名雄心勃勃的年轻战士 带领一支伟大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was an ambitious young warrior leading a great army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.62,0:26:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,与我并肩作战的就是天煞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fighting by my side was Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我最亲密的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My closest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.13,0:26:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天 我们遭到了埋伏 我身负重伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day we were ambushed. I was badly wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.98,0:27:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友背着我日以继夜地寻求帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend carried me for days looking for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.07,0:27:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最后我们来到一个高山上的神秘村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we came to a secret village, high in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.88,0:27:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,古老的疗伤圣地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ancient place of healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.97,0:27:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,全村都是熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A village of pandas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.54,0:27:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 熊猫 - 对 熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pandas? - Yes, pandas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.95,0:27:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,熊猫他们用气功治好了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pandas who used the power of chi to heal me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.41,0:27:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还教会我如何释放气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They taught me how to give chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.13,0:27:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但天煞想独占所有气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Kai, wanted the power all to himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他发现气既能被给予 也能被夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw that what could be given could also be taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打得山摇地动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our battle shook the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:28:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,最终 我将他打入灵界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until, finally, I banished Kai to the Spirit Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,若他重返人间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should he ever return to the mortal realm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.72,0:28:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有真正的气功大师才能阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can only be stopped by a true Master of chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.06,0:28:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的气功大师 比如你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True Master of chi? Like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.99,0:28:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我只能发功让花盛开而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I can barely make a flower bloom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.10,0:28:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我至少还要在山洞里修炼三十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd need at least thirty more years, and a cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.55,0:28:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个气功大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a chi Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他会继续夺走别的大师的气 世上就再也没气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will continue stealing the chi of Masters until he has consumed it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.23,0:28:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须想办法阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to make a way to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.26,0:28:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,败下的大师越多 他得到的气也就越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets more more powerful with every Master he defeats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.09,0:28:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没别的选择 只能去战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no choice. We fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.75,0:28:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以教你 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can teach you, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可以教我 - 当然 我是只熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can do this? - Of course, I'm a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定是宇宙让你来的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be why the universe sent you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那我要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what do I have to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.91,0:28:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要跟我回家 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to come home with me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.84,0:28:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回到神秘村庄 - 对 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To the secret village? - Yes, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须重新学会如何做一只熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must rediscover what it is to be a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你要学会如何像熊猫那样生活 像熊猫那样睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to learn how to live like a panda. Sleep like a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像熊猫那样吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat like a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.73,0:29:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,103个包子 还没够我塞牙缝呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those 103 dumplings? I was just warming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直认为 我吃东西的潜力还没全部挖掘出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always felt like I wasn't eating up to my full potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把我们家阿宝带走 不不 我要别的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take Po away from me. No, no I want a second opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.54,0:29:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅 再开一卷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shifu, open another scroll or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.35,0:29:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得他应该去 - 好 再来个意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think he should go. - Fine. A third opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.51,0:29:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,金猴 灵蛇 娇虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkey? Viper? Tigress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.97,0:29:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 你也听到师傅说的和乌龟写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you heard what Shifu said, Oogway said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只有真正的气功大师才能阻止天煞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy can only be stopped by a Master of chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.49,0:29:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而我只有知道我究竟是谁才能学会用气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can only master chi by knowing who I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.21,0:29:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我是熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我去给你准备路上的午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pack your lunch for the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.01,0:29:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的认为阿宝能及时学会气功吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think Po can master chi in time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.14,0:29:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的想法并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.83,0:29:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 宇宙怎么想才是最重要的 - 所以答案是不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It only matters what the universe thinks. - So, that's a "No"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 师傅 我们要做什么 - 你去查明天煞的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Master, what are we going to do? - You are going to find out where Kai is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:30:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,寻着那些翡翠僵尸的踪迹 但千万别跟他打起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow the trail of those jade creatures but do not engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.25,0:30:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因为天煞会越战越强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For with every foe he faces Kai becomes stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么选我 是因为我多嘴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why me? Is it because I asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.56,0:30:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 因为你能飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it is because you can fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去吧 - 早知道就闭上你的鸟嘴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! - Should have kept your beak shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.83,0:30:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 带上螳螂 - 什么 因为我插嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And take Mantis. - What? Oh man, is it because I...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,吃点东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, lunch break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.65,0:30:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用同样问题问两遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to ask me twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.09,0:30:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸 - 干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸 - 啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.03,0:30:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.61,0:30:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我在干什么 我背疼死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing? Getting a backache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.01,0:30:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你非得在每块石头上踩着走吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have to step on every rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我是说你怎么在这 - 那你说我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I mean why are you here? - What was I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不喜欢吃那些熊猫的东西怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the pandas don't have food you like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.72,0:31:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿着肚子的话 怎么去拯救世界呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're never gonna be able to save the world on an empty stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.79,0:31:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我跟着你攸关成败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consider my presence mission critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,关于这点 我们不能告诉外人村庄的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes about that. We can't share the location of the village with others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.69,0:31:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以 - 你认为我守不住秘密 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So... - Well, you think I can't keep a secret, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.98,0:31:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我养了阿宝二十年才告诉他 他不是我亲生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I raised Po for 20 years before I finally told him he was adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seriously? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.29,0:31:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我想 让你飞回去是有点残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I guess it would be cruel to make you fly back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.30,0:31:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你竟然会飞 - 鹅也是鸟好吗 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can fly? - I'm a bird, Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.30,0:31:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.61,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去还要很长一段路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure looks like a long ways up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子最讨厌爬阶梯了 我们还是回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my son hates stairs. So, let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.61,0:32:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是熊猫 我们才不爬阶梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pandas. We don't do stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.14,0:32:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我一辈子都在等着这句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've waited my whole life to hear those words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.43,0:32:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,扯淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.44,0:32:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是神秘熊猫村 难怪你们要保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the secret panda village? No wonder you keep it a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.10,0:32:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我住在这 我也不好意思告诉别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I lived here, I wouldn't tell anyone either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你可以"哇"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you can whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.72,0:33:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,李山 大家注意 李山回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Li? Everyone, Li is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来了两个人 - 他找到儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're both back. - He found his son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.63,0:33:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他做到了 - 他们回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He made it. - They're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.80,0:33:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 李山 - 他找到他儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Li? - He found his son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 李山回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, Li is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.32,0:33:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, we're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.81,0:33:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他成功了 - 为什么我们要跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He made it! - Why are we running?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他做到了 - 李山回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He made it. - Li shan is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.18,0:34:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都围过来吧 这是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, everyone gather around. This is my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.70,0:34:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. Hi. - Cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.89,0:34:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 三胞胎 - 嗨 我是酷酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Triplets! - Hi, I'm Ku Ku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.14,0:34:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是萌萌 - 我是帅帅 他闻起来像饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Meng Meng. - I'm Shuai Shuai, he smells like cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.26,0:34:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他好帅啊 跟他老爸一样帅 - 谢谢夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's so handsome. Just like his father. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.25,0:34:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 他们是你的表哥 点点和心心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, these are your cousins. Dim and Sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.74,0:34:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我竟然有表哥 - 欢迎 - 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have cousins. - Welcome. - Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.91,0:34:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 串在一起的包子 - 我们叫它小吃项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buns on a string. - We call it a snacklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.20,0:34:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会再给你做一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make you another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.93,0:34:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 嗨 - 其实我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, that's nice to see you. Hi. - I don't know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.49,0:34:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,花娃娃 好漂亮啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stripey baby, So beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.04,0:34:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 那是我的人偶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, careful with that. That's my action figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.48,0:34:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能送我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I keep her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.52,0:34:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Noooo... - Can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.78,0:34:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没 问题 当然没问题 我带来就是要送给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...problem. Of course, yeah that's why I brought her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.93,0:34:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好好照顾她 - 肯定会 花娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take good care of her. - Yes, stripey baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.48,0:34:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来就像婴儿版的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look just like me but a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.07,0:35:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像老年版的我 你就是胖点的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like me but old. You're like me but fatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.21,0:35:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like me but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.17,0:35:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着帽子的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他确实戴着帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He does wear a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.39,0:35:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看起来都和我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all look like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去大吃一顿吧 庆祝我儿子回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's feast in my son's honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.75,0:35:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 熊猫不用走的 我们滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the...? - Pandas don't walk! We roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.22,0:35:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你有见过这么可笑的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you ever seen anyone look so ridiculous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 你在干什么 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, what are you doing? Po?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对 的确比走路强多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. That is better than walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.05,0:35:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - That's nice stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:35:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吃点包子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, have some dumplings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:35:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有不会滚的熊猫呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of panda doesn't know how to roll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.71,0:36:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在当熊猫这方面 我还是新人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm kinda new at this whole being a panda thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.01,0:36:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么品种的熊猫啊 你脖子好搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what kind of panda are you? You have a funny neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.47,0:36:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不是熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a panda at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.65,0:36:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 那个呢 这个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that? What's that? What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的帽子 我的嘴 我的翅膀 我的包子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hat, My beak, My wing, My dumplings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.97,0:36:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别再问问题了 坐好 小屁孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more questions. Go away, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.49,0:36:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 儿子 给你 我给你带了筷子 - 谢谢你 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, son, I packed your chopsticks. - Thanks, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.64,0:36:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 那是干什么用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What are those for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 这是筷子 用来夹包子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These? These are chopsticks. They're for picking up dumplings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.33,0:36:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说 你只一口一个包子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you only eat one at a time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.75,0:36:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道我在吃方面潜力无限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I wasn't eating up to my potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是美美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Mei Mei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.18,0:36:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她真是花容月貌 美若天仙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's amazing. She's so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴真甜 阿宝 不过留着些好话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's sweet, Po, but please try to save all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:37:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等我表演完了再夸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}other compliments until after the performance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.91,0:37:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我 不 我没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? No, I didn't say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.85,0:37:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别说话 表演完再夸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it. After the performance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.46,0:37:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还没开始吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has it started yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,全天下最棒的彩带舞者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best ribbon dancer in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.07,0:37:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少她是这么说的 - 看 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At least that's what she says. - Look away, look away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.04,0:37:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你做不到 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't. Can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 为啥她一直那样盯着我看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, why does she keep staring at me like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.07,0:37:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,试着跟上姐的舞步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.14,0:37:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我真不知道怎么跳舞 - 你当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't really know how to dance. - Of course you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.85,0:37:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所有熊猫都会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All pandas dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你在想什么 - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know what you're thinking. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.26,0:37:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一只熊猫怎么能如此貌美呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can one panda be so beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.22,0:37:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 送我的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - For me? Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.62,0:37:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮帮我 老爸 - 哦 不 你得自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me, dads. - Yeah, no. You're on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.34,0:37:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跳的不错 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing great, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.92,0:37:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.65,0:38:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.39,0:38:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 你会掌握窍门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, you'll get the hang of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.36,0:38:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我要学的东西多着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have so much to learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.92,0:38:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪之翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wings of surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.20,0:38:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说那个干嘛 - 说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you do that? - Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在做的事情前面加上"之翼"什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because you say "Wings of"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.57,0:38:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可不代表你的做法有多特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before something it doesn't mean that you're doing a special move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.34,0:38:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像我说"强力之刃"或者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like me saying, "Antenna of power" or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.13,0:38:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"三明治之喉"那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thorax of making sandwiches"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.84,0:38:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 反对之翼 - 哇 那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wings of disagreement. - Whoa, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.43,0:38:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,熊大师 鸡大师 鳄鱼大师 你们在这干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Bear, Master Chicken, Master Croc, what are you doing out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.04,0:38:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,翡翠军团袭击了我们的村庄 我们追到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jade creatures attacked our villages. We've tracked them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.08,0:38:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.14,0:38:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一定在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.67,0:38:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,师父让我们坚决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Shifu strongly advised us....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要和他交手 - 我们必须进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...not to engage. - We got to get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但师父说 - 你害怕了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But Master Shifu said... - You're seriously afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.90,0:39:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,连鸡大师都进去了 他可是只鸡啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Master Chicken's going in there and he's a chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.65,0:39:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么定了 我要进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.14,0:39:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,螳螂 我们有命令在身 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mantis, we have orders not to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.75,0:39:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要帮忙 快点 我从上方攻击 你从下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need our help. Come on. I'll go high, you go low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.57,0:39:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.22,0:39:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,难道还怕只虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear the bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.83,0:39:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看着 你个小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, you little...!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.92,0:39:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 伙计 我来了 - "强力之刃"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on, buddy. I'm coming. - "Antenna of power"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 怎么不管用 - 螳螂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, it didn't work! - Mantis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.56,0:39:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,螳螂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mantis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.99,0:39:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,螳螂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mantis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.05,0:40:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的气很强 和你的朋友一样 那个小虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chi is strong, just like your friend, the bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 螳螂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? Mantis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.37,0:40:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 小鸟儿 我会让你的真气派上好用场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, little birdie. I'll put your chi to good use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.78,0:40:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我将毁掉翡翠宫和它里面的每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroying the Jade palace and everyone in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.66,0:40:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,悔过 之翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wings of...regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.13,0:40:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没错 熊猫训练的第一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah, first day of panda training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.03,0:40:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 花儿 我会让你开放的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright flower, I'm gonna make you bloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.39,0:40:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.42,0:40:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛 干嘛 什么事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.63,0:40:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好迎接第一天的熊猫训练啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready for my first day of panda training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.25,0:40:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.89,0:40:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就是学着怎么做只熊猫啊 一位气功大师 拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, learn to be a panda, Master chi, save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.89,0:41:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,熊猫要睡到午后才起床的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pandas sleep till past noon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.09,0:41:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以第一课就是回被窝接着睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So lesson number one is go back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.81,0:41:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.83,0:41:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没听说过这玩意这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody said this was gonna be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.78,0:41:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我睡过头了吗 - 哈哈 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I oversleep? - Ha, ha! You sure did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.61,0:41:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.77,0:41:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 孩子们 给他示范一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, show him kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.07,0:41:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你能这样吗 能这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do this? Can you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.75,0:41:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样呢 还有这样呢 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about this? How about that? - Hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.11,0:41:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我做的对吗 这样好不好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I doing it? Is this good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样 我会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.78,0:41:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 熊猫奶奶 小心头顶 - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grandma panda, heads up. - Ow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 我们还是打滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. - We better roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.45,0:41:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 午饭时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, lunchtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.14,0:41:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 你要顺其自然的滚才行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po. You gotta let the hill tell you where to roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.39,0:41:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,菜鸟都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rookie mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,点点 心心 让他看看我们是如何上山的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dim, Sum, let's show him how we go uphill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.66,0:41:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太帅了 - 吃点心啦 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's beautiful. - Snack time. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:42:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿宝 你会飞了 - 全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Po, you can fly? - I'm coming in hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.39,0:42:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那就等凉了再吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them while they're cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.70,0:42:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这干嘛 那些是给阿宝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing there? That food is for Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,下锅咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.30,0:42:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抱抱 抱抱 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there, that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 感到放松了吗 - 嗯 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Feeling relaxed? - Yeah, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只要顺其自然就好 - 懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just let yourself fall into it. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.10,0:42:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 我只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.75,0:42:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 都吐出来就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go. Just let it all out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.92,0:42:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是我的好孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.74,0:42:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.10,0:42:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的面条 别动我的面条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My noodles. Leave my noodles alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.58,0:42:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 讨厌 阿宝 真讨厌 - 我也要抱抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Subtle, Po. Very subtle. - Let me get some of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.78,0:42:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别吃我的帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And leave my hat alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.32,0:43:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们爱吃面条 - 噢 多像阿宝小的时候啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We love noodles! - Oh, just like my Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.84,0:43:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.85,0:43:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是这样滚的 发炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how we roll. Cannonball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.64,0:43:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoo-hoo. Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.99,0:43:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 看呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, look it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.18,0:43:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这次怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.97,0:43:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在你再试一次 但别太用力 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now you try again but don't try so hard. - Okay, Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.74,0:44:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 老爸 - 谢什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, dad. - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.51,0:44:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的 就是 告诉我做一只熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, just for you know, showing me what it feels like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎样的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.88,0:44:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你究竟认为我什么时候能准备充分呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when do you think I'll be ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.24,0:44:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,准备充分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.09,0:44:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就是学习怎样掌握气功呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, to learn how to master chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.23,0:44:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很快 很快就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, real soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.84,0:44:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我想给你看点别的 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I wanna show you something else. Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.82,0:44:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好意思 这里乱七八糟的 我这很少有来访者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about the mess, I don't usually get visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.08,0:44:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我妈妈么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this my mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.60,0:44:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你百日的时候完成了这幅画像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had this done on your one hundredth day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.17,0:45:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈根本没法让你安静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mama couldn't hold you still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你差点把这张纸给吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You nearly eat the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.29,0:45:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 她什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's true. - What was she like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.03,0:45:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她简直完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the total package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.31,0:45:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明 美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart, beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.74,0:45:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,食量巨大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tremendous appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.93,0:45:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我一生的挚爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the love of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.54,0:45:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 就在我觉得人生达到最美满的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, just when I thought I couldn't get any luckier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.02,0:45:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你降临了 我的小莲花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along you came, my Little Lotus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.03,0:45:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我真的拥有了世界的全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really had it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.49,0:45:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,直到那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until that one moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.96,0:45:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.67,0:45:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,又失去了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.44,0:46:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 你再也不用担心会失去我了 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you don't have to worry about losing me ever again, Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.37,0:46:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让我也来抱抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me get some of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.54,0:46:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,从东部来的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from the eastern province.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:47:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,蜥蜴大师 红牛大师 猎鹰大师 他们全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Lizard, Master Ox, Master Eagle, all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,隔海相望的每一座村庄 天底下每一位功夫大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In every village from the sea to here. Every Master in china...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.63,0:47:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都不见了 - 也许他们都去参加某个宴会了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...has vanished. - Maybe they are all at a party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.48,0:47:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 灵猴 - 我也没被邀请呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Monkey. - I didn't get invited either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.96,0:47:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是天煞吸走了他们的真气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai has taken their chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.20,0:47:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只有我们能阻止他了 而龟仙人留下的真传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all that stand between him and the knowledge Oogway left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.73,0:47:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只有靠我们来守护了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in our care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.95,0:47:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 村民们都疏散了吗 - 全部疏散了 师父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The villagers, evacuated? - Done, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.12,0:47:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 仙鹤和螳螂呢 - 还没有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Crane? Mantis? - Still nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.35,0:47:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 等等 他们回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh! Wait, it's them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.43,0:47:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.57,0:47:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.55,0:47:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 你们就这点本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice, very tacky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.62,0:47:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆敢踏上这片土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you set foot on these grounds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.39,0:48:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你们这群可怜的傻瓜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at your pathetic fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.98,0:48:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道在乌龟的脚下卑躬屈膝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Groveling at the feet of Oogway the magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.06,0:48:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不配提及他的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not fit to speak his name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.43,0:48:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不配吗 小猫咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not fit, little kitten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.06,0:48:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾与他并肩作战 我待他如同手足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought by his side. I loved him like a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.08,0:48:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而他却背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.09,0:48:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我就毁了他所创造的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I will destroy everything he has created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.36,0:48:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.88,0:48:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小猫咪让你感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that for a little kitten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.77,0:49:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你毁了龟仙人的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not let you destroy Oogway's memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不呢 他可是毁掉了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not? He destroyed mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,螳螂 是我啊 你的好哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mantis, it is me, your bestie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.17,0:49:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 娇虎 抱歉 抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry Tigress. Sorry, sorry, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.53,0:49:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 师父 - 把他们都给我带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shifu. - Bring them to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:50:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 你必须去找阿宝 - 师父 求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! You must warn Po. - Master please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.69,0:50:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让我给你见识 什么才叫真正的气功吧 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will show you the true power of chi, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.00,0:50:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.99,0:50:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,龟仙人 原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oogway, forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:51:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 乌龟 你想说什么 你原谅他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, what do you say Oogway? Do you forgive him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.98,0:51:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你也许能毁掉翡翠宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have destroyed the Jade palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.96,0:51:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但你永远不会得逞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you will never succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,总会有人能阻止你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will always be someone to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁 那只熊猫 他的真气很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? The panda? His chi is strong but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.59,0:51:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但那还远远不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it won't be enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.80,0:51:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会落得和你一样的下场 - 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He will meet the same fate as you. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.67,0:51:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,并且那个村子里每一只熊猫都会如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so will every panda in that village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.32,0:51:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.30,0:51:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 我希望你准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, I hope you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.75,0:51:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,跳舞吧 小莲花 跳舞呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dance Lotus, dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.40,0:51:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个帅小伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's so handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.74,0:51:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 来个熊抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - That's a panda hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.03,0:51:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.68,0:52:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.61,0:52:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 娇虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh! Tigress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.63,0:52:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.04,0:52:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 花娃娃 - 你怎么来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Baby stripey baby. - What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.29,0:52:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,天煞袭击了山谷 他抓走了那里所有的功夫大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kai attacked the valley. He's taken every Master in china{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.65,0:52:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,包括师父他们 他们 全都走了 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including Shifu and the others. It's...it's all gone, Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.71,0:53:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切 所有人 - 所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything, everyone. - Everyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有人 - 那我的面馆呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone. - How's my restaurant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.97,0:53:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一会再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll talk later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.08,0:53:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 现在他正在来这里的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now he's on his way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.10,0:53:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他是冲着你来的 阿宝 还有所有的熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's after you, Po. He's after all pandas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.41,0:53:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还有多长时间 - 不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long do we have? - Not long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.73,0:53:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快告诉我你已经学会气功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you've mastered chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.88,0:53:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里 抱着孩子 - 老爸 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, take the baby. - Dad, dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.56,0:53:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这孩子是谁家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, who belongs to this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.73,0:53:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在必须教我气功的秘诀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to teach me the secret chi technique now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不行 恐怕你还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. I'm afraid you need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.04,0:53:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快收拾好行装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, go get your things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.98,0:53:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我替你拿着 - 我没时间了 我得立刻学才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me hand you that. - I don't have more time. I need to learn it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.16,0:53:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 你还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, you're not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.65,0:53:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 把所有东西都装好 - 我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, pack everything. - I am ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.65,0:53:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.48,0:53:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是什么意思啊 你说的每一件事我都照做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? I've done everything you've asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.57,0:53:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我学会了了打瞌睡 在吊床上睡觉 泡热水澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Mastered napping, sleeping in hammocks, the hot tubs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.07,0:53:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全学会如何做一只熊猫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am totally in one with my panda parts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.07,0:53:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你现在还是不能教我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, why won't you show me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.15,0:53:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我根本就不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't know it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.64,0:53:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.71,0:53:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会气功 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know it, Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.49,0:53:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会 或许曾经有人会 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one does. Maybe we used to but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.09,0:53:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早已失传了 - 你骗了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But not anymore. - You lied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.11,0:53:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.19,0:54:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.48,0:54:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.86,0:54:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.72,0:54:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说有个耍刀的疯子到处找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find out some blade-swinging maniac is coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.27,0:54:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.94,0:54:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 袖手旁观吗 - 当然 我是神龙大侠啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just...just let that happen? - Yes, I'm the Dragon Warrior!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.78,0:54:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对付那些疯子 那是我的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Facing maniacs, that's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.41,0:54:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但因为你 我让整个村庄都失去庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But because of you, I left the valley unprotected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.28,0:54:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我让我的朋友失去保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left my friends unprotected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.38,0:54:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在他们都 他们都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now they're all...they're all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.48,0:54:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你留下来也会和他们一样被抓走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you would have been, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.99,0:54:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我失去过你一次 我不能再次失去你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost you once. I am not going to lose you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.29,0:54:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.96,0:54:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经失去我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.86,0:54:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 抱着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, pick me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.57,0:55:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 我担心死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, I'm so worried for you that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.64,0:55:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,以至于一切如我所料都没能让我开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even enjoy being right about everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在逃吧 逃吧 逃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now run, run, run,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.46,0:55:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,甩开你那小胖腿用最快速度逃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as fast as those chubby legs can go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.19,0:55:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 逃 现在已经无处可逃了 - 那你打算怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run? There's nowhere to run. - What are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要留下 打倒那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna stay and fight that monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.33,0:55:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 他可能是个混蛋 但他到底还是你爸爸啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, he may be a monster but he's still your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.86,0:55:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是他 是天煞 - 啊 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not him, Kai. - Huh! No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.06,0:56:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你饿吗 - 不 真的 不饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hungry? - No, I... not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.82,0:56:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就吃一个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.70,0:56:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 说谎的人不止你一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you weren't the only one who was lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.67,0:56:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我来到这里 不是因为我担心阿宝会挨饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't really come along because I was worried Po would go hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.33,0:56:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我担心的是你 - 你担心我会挨饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was worried about you. - Worried that I'd go hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.98,0:56:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我担心你会把阿宝从我身边夺走 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I was worried you'd steal Po from me. - I'd what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.06,0:56:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这想法很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. That was crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.29,0:56:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但后来我意识到阿宝的人生出现了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I realized having you in Po's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.02,0:56:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那并不是我的损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean less for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.14,0:56:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,而是意味着阿宝得到的爱更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means more for Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.88,0:56:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.08,0:56:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 他的人生已经不要我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. I'm not in his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.97,0:56:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再也不要我了 - 你儿子生你气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not any more. - Your son got mad at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.01,0:56:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入为人父母的行列 - 你不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to parenthood. - You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.27,0:57:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我骗了他 他再也不会原谅我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lied to him. He'll never forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.66,0:57:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我骗了他二十年啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lied to him for 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.52,0:57:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直以为他是从一颗蛋里孵出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still thinks he came from an egg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.84,0:57:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我们所做的错事 往往是出于善意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes we do the wrong things for the right reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.91,0:57:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, he's hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.78,0:57:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也很迷茫 但他还是选择了拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's confused and he still has to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正是他最需要我们的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs the both his dads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.36,0:57:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样没有用 - 会有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't going to work. - It has to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.10,0:57:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你现在头脑不清醒 - 我很清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You 're not thinking straight. - I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.05,0:57:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not. - I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.28,0:57:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 是的 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.86,0:58:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过天煞 我知道他的本事如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen Kai. I've seen what he can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.74,0:58:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但他还没领略过我的本领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he hasn't seen what I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,无须铁指扣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wuxi finger hold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.07,0:58:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的绝招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my best move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.20,0:58:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要找到天煞 捏住他的手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have to get to Kai, grab his finger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.19,0:58:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 走你 他就能滚回灵界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then, Skadoosh. Back to the Spirit Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.71,0:58:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一支翡翠军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has an army of jade warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.75,0:58:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们见过的一切他都能够感知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything they see he sees{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.59,0:58:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你根本无法抓住他的把柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so there's no sneaking up on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.31,0:58:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没法近他身 - 这招会管用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You will never get close enough. - It's gonna work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.27,0:58:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只有真正的气功大师才能够阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can only be stopped by a Master of chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.85,0:58:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你跟师父的腔调一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you sound just like Shifu with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.34,0:58:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,气功 气功 气功 这个气 那个气 气 气 气 气 气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the chi chi chi. Chi this. Chi that. Chi chi chi chi chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.14,0:58:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是气功大师 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a Master of chi. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.72,0:58:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道我是不是什么神龙大侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I'm the Dragon Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.90,0:58:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道我是不是只熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know if I'm a panda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.90,0:58:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我连我自己是谁都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.80,0:58:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.03,0:58:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法阻止他和他的大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way I can stop him and his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.44,0:58:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你有一支你自己的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you had an army of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.35,0:58:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 不仅仅是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You? - Not just me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.64,0:59:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们 - 我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Us. - All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.70,0:59:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年之后我终于找到了我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally found my son after all these years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就算世界末日也不能把我们分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna take a lot more than the end of the world to keep us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.33,0:59:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但你们都不会功夫啊 - 你可以教我们啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you don't even know kung fu. - Then you will teach us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.42,0:59:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我教不了你功夫 我连娇虎都教不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I can't teach you kung fu. I couldn't even teach Tigress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.21,0:59:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而她还是功夫高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she already knows kung fu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.17,0:59:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 我知道我现在是你最不愿信任的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, I know I'm the last guy you wanna trust right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.90,0:59:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但你必须相信我 我们能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta believe me. We can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.22,0:59:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以学会功夫 我们可以变成你那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can learn kung fu. We can be just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.01,0:59:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.54,0:59:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 我们能做到 - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh... We can do this? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.08,0:59:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们可以学会功夫 - 后面一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can learn kung fu? - After that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我 我们可以变成你那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... I... We can be just like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.80,0:59:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我们真能做到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - We can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.13,0:59:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.32,1:00:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们不必像我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't have to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.73,1:00:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,师父当初就是这个意思 我不必把你们变成另一个我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what Shifu meant. I don't have to turn you into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.00,1:00:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做的是激发你们自身的潜能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to turn you into you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.65,1:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本说不通啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.31,1:00:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.66,1:00:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢爸爸们 - 不用谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, dads. - You're welcome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.48,1:00:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做件自己从未想过能办到的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna do something I never thought I'd be able to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.36,1:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要教功夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna teach kung fu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.31,1:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 展现出自己最好的水平就是你们真正的优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, your real strength comes from being the best you you can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.55,1:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你是谁 你擅长什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who are you? What are you good at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.33,1:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你热衷什么 何为你的个人特色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you love? What makes you you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.44,1:00:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好 接着踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, good. Good, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.67,1:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.70,1:00:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 非常好 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, good, good, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.70,1:00:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 花娃娃 花娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huh? - Stripey baby, stripey baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.24,1:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 再快点 挥动这些绸带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster, faster. Roll those ribbons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.21,1:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱紧这根木头 就像是你平生最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hug that log, you. Hug that log{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.32,1:00:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,拥抱它一样 把这当作是最后的道别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like it's the last time you're ever gonna hug it. Goodbye forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,高点 这次稍微偏向左边 你能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Higher, and a little more to the left this time. You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.37,1:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想看到任何一个包子接触地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna see any of these hit the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.19,1:01:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 给花娃娃留点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, save Stripy Baby some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.11,1:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, try it with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.54,1:01:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 试试这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now try it with these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.88,1:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, now try it with these.{\r}
