Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.75,1:10:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿宝 - 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Po. - Son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.84,1:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,走你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skadoosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.64,1:11:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 儿子 - 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Son! - Son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.62,1:11:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.31,1:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aw! - Aw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.74,1:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 阿宝去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... What happened? Where is Po?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.57,1:11:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他带走了天煞 也救了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took Kai away. He saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.84,1:11:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.80,1:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他救了我们 那谁来救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved us but who's saving him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.53,1:11:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 灵界 管用了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, the Spirit Realm! It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别骑我 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me, you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.12,1:11:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你带我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought me back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.02,1:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别怪我 我试过在凡界解决这事 但没成功啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't blame me. I tried to finish this in the regular realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.68,1:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们在这了结吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll finish it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.34,1:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 儿子 跟他拼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, son. Fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.75,1:12:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得帮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.05,1:12:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得帮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.22,1:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大家都围过来 就是这样 靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everyone gather around. That's it. Come in close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.23,1:12:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 我们能办到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.38,1:13:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 是你教会了我们要做真实的自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po, you taught us who we were meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.55,1:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朋友 - 踢包小将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A friend. - A dumpling kicker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.00,1:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 致命老奶奶 - 拥抱者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A lethal fighting machine. - A hugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.70,1:13:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,双截棍女侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nunchuck chick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.02,1:13:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,花娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stripey baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.17,1:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.49,1:13:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.24,1:14:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.17,1:14:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.91,1:14:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有同样的困惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been asking the same question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.56,1:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是熊猫之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I the son of a panda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.77,1:14:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还是大鹅之子 我是学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son of a goose? A student?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.26,1:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还是老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A teacher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.95,1:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我发现 我四者皆是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out, I'm all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.09,1:14:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是神龙大侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the Dragon Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.41,1:14:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗 看到这条巨龙了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it? See the giant dragon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.12,1:14:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.38,1:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好感受这惊天巨雷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to feel the thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.00,1:14:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.18,1:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,吼吼 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ho ho ho ho. Ha ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.98,1:15:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waa hoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.11,1:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.69,1:15:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,肚皮锣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belly gong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.11,1:15:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,神龙摆尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butt slap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.39,1:15:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要不先吃点午餐吧 我饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a bit of lunch cause I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.14,1:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.04,1:15:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,接招吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.87,1:15:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小心噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.58,1:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了五百年才夺走乌龟的气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took me 500 years to take Oogway's chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.86,1:16:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为了夺走你的气 我愿意再花五百年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have yours if it takes me 500 more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.48,1:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,废话 废话 都是废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chtity chitty chat chat, chitchat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.99,1:16:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么想要我的气 那就拿去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want my chi so bad? Then take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.62,1:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 力量归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the power is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.08,1:16:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不 太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, no. It's too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.95,1:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too much. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.16,1:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noooo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.26,1:17:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.41,1:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们回来了 - 好朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're back. - Bestie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.35,1:17:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是绿的 没用啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still green. It didn't work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.38,1:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,噢等等 这是我正常时的绿色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh wait, that's my normal green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.90,1:17:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绿娃娃 - 我不是娃娃 不是娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Greeny baby. - Not a baby, not a baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.37,1:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是令人畏惧的螳螂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antenna of Fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.03,1:17:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Po?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.26,1:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到阿宝了吗 - 没有 他不在这吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen Po? - No, he's not here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.73,1:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宝 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Po? Po?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.38,1:17:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't he back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.67,1:17:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 神龙大侠 - 乌龟 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dragon warrior. - Oogway? Whoaaa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.27,1:18:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.04,1:18:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 你格外耀眼 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa, you're extra shiny. - As are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.50,1:18:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 简直是史上最好的披风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, right? It's like the best cape ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.59,1:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当我披着它奔跑时 看起来超酷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I run with it, then it looks really cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.97,1:18:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,披风很适合你 你长大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It suits you. You've grown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.30,1:18:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我不能再吃熊猫大餐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I gotta lay off the panda buffet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.59,1:18:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说你变成熟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.25,1:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当我把消息传给你父亲时 我就期待你能变成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I hoped you would when I sent the message to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.21,1:18:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.07,1:18:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,原来那条宇宙消息是你发的啊 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent the universe mail? Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 因为宇宙需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, because the universe needed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.26,1:18:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.53,1:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于变成了自己命中注定的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You finally became the panda you were always meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.04,1:18:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但你怎么知道我能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how'd you know I could?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.33,1:18:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们初次见面的那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the first day we met...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.64,1:18:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了功夫的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the future of kung fu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.75,1:18:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也看到了过往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.17,1:18:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了那只能将两者合二为一的熊猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the panda who could unite them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.49,1:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我选你的原因 阿宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I chose you, Po.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.65,1:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你结合了阴阳两极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both sides of the Yin and Yang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.74,1:19:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我真正的继承者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my true successor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.77,1:19:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗 我 我可不能收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I can't... I can't take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.43,1:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.20,1:19:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有根更大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a bigger one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你悟性已经那么高了 而我只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're enlightening and everything. I'm just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.90,1:19:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh. Ooooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.08,1:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.00,1:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在我们怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.36,1:19:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, you tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.47,1:19:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 乌龟 别走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Oogway, don't go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.84,1:19:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪都不会去 我住在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere. I live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.50,1:19:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.66,1:19:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要决定去留的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you who must decide whether to stay or go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.85,1:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 我能回去吗 - 谁知道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, I can go back? - Who knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.49,1:19:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.51,1:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!{\r}
